                "text": "Check AICTE approval for the exact programme."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Check UGC/UGC-DEB status for university-run or online diplomas."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Ask for a real, verifiable placement record."
